<title>UK: Vodafone names Chris Gent as new CEO.</title>
<headline>Vodafone names Chris Gent as new CEO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vodafone Group Plc said Chris Gent would become its chief executive when Sir Gerald Whent retires on December 31, 1996.  </p>
<p>Whent will become a non-executive director and deputy chairman from January 1 1997.</p>
<p>Gent, 48, is currently a director of Vodafone Group and managing director of Vodafone Ltd, a position he has held since joining the company on January 1 1985.</p>
<p>Whent, 69, has been Vodafone chief executive since the group was formed 13 years ago.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
